# Rainbow playable scenery experiments

The five specialists were tested independently from the latest verified Claudia checkpoints. Each mobile package opens with three separate native images and includes full steering pairs and two continuous stage rides.

## 07 · Dive the Washer Tube

**Candidate for owner review.** The third gold paddle now reads as a rounded metal piece during steering. Its photographed front and shaded underside stay on the same solid. The magenta banks still straighten during steering and white sides still dominate parts of the plunge. Those changes overlap Claudia’s unfinished bank and plunge work. A small amber transition near the back of the paddle is easiest to inspect at +10.

