## 06 · Crest the Rinse Arch

**Candidate for owner review.** The rings turn to the right with the tunnel as Benny leaves the crest. The distant passage is easier to follow during forward travel. The pale patch under Benny at crest release, long cyan streaks and foam overlapping his lower body still need attention. Some distant rings remain repetitive.

