## 04 · Through the Five Arrows

**Candidate for owner review.** The pink banks now sweep across the existing trough as Benny passes the arrows. Farther down, the copper corridor and repeated arrows still have less variation than the painted entrance. The separate gold-ring specialist remains a distinct checkpoint.

