## 05 · Flow into the Current

**Candidate for owner review.** The perforations read more clearly in close steered views. Their positions and the surrounding reflections stay in place. Near the last bend the water still draws into long streaks, and the transition into the next specialist’s environment remains abrupt. This is a wall-detail improvement.

