## 08 · Final Spin Chamber

**Candidate for owner review.** The foreground current now turns under Benny while the door, towel, platform and spouts hold their positions. Glossy cyan still stretches at +3, and the near pink bank can dominate the lower frame. The two full-steer collision poses each cost one heart in both builds. The successful inlet-to-exit rides retain all five.

